<p> 2 Computer Power	    3.61    3.70</p>
<p> 3 Premier Inv		 3.95    0.70</p>
<p> 4 BTR Plc		     5.59    5.20</p>
<p> 5 Parbury Ltd		 5.66    0.67</p>
<p> 6 Queensland Cotton	 5.68    4.31</p>
